## Mechanistic insight into gold nanorod transformation in nanoscale confinement of ZIF-8
Cheongwon Bae\(^{1}\), Jaedeok Lee\(^{1}\), Lehan Yao\(^{2}\), Suhyeon Park\(^{1}\), Yeonju Lee\(^{1}\), Jieun Lee\(^{1}\), Qian Chen\(^{2,3,4,5}\), and Juyeong Kim\(^{1}\) (✉)
